# Capabilities tree gitignore (round 2).
#
# See ../LAYOUT.md for the uniform layout this gitignore enforces.
#
# Policy: this directory holds capability *experiments*. We commit:
#   - capability.md, capability.config.json         (the spec)
#   - capability.jsonl                              (append-only iter log)
#   - rubric.py, rubric_sanity.py                   (composite reward + sanity)
#   - build_corpus.py, rollout.py                   (contract; reviewable)
#   - capability.oracle.sh, run_iter.sh             (run scripts)
#   - capability.anchor.sh                          (SFT regression watch)
#   - hypotheses/<slug>.md                          (planning + verdicts)
#   - prompts/train.jsonl                           (OPD/SFT training prompts)
#   - datasets/train.tasks.jsonl                    (the training tasks)
#   - calibration/{good,bad}.jsonl                  (rubric sanity fixtures)
#   - manifest/<iter>.json                          (reproducibility manifests)
#   - archive/                                      (round-1 history)
#
# We do NOT commit:

# --- Blind-eval firewall: never let eval contents or per-example judgments enter git ---
**/datasets/eval.jsonl
**/datasets/eval.tasks.jsonl
**/judgments/

# --- Adapter binaries: regenerable from training data + manifest + git SHA ---
# Round 2: kiln #5 + #36 — adapter_manifest.json + kiln adapter restore is the
# canonical provenance; the binary lives in /workspace/adapters or B2.
**/adapters/

# --- Teacher fixture caches: large, regenerable from teacher + prompts ---
**/datasets/teacher.fixture*.jsonl
**/datasets/*.fixture.jsonl

# --- Live inspection / training artifacts ---
**/responses/
**/experiments/
**/.oracle-build/
**/.eval/
**/iter-artifacts/

# --- Round 2: trainer-owned per-run artifacts are written under /tmp ---
# but if they slip into a cap dir, don't commit them.
**/train_receipt.json
**/adapter_receipt.json
**/eval_summary.json

# --- All log files at any depth ---
**/*.log

# --- Python / Jupyter housekeeping ---
**/__pycache__/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.pyc
